{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 132,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Song of degrees. LORD, remember David ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all his afflictions;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "How he swore to the LORD, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " vowed to the mighty ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Jacob;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely I will not come into the tabernacle of my house, nor go up into my bed;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will not give sleep to my eyes, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " slumber to my eyelids,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Until I find a place for the LORD, a habitation for the mighty ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, we heard of it at Ephratah: we found it in the fields of the wood.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "We will go into his tabernacles: we will worship at his footstool.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O LORD, into thy rest; thou, and the ark of thy strength.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy priests be clothed with righteousness; and let thy saints shout for joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thy servant David's sake turn not away the face of thy anointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD hath sworn ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " truth to David; he will not turn from it; Of the fruit of thy body will I set upon thy throne.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If thy children will keep my covenant and my testimony that I shall teach them; their children also shall sit upon thy throne for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD hath chosen Zion; he hath desired ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for his habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my rest for ever: here will I dwell; for I have desired it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will abundantly bless her provision: I will satisfy her poor with bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will also clothe her priests with salvation, and her saints shall shout aloud for joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There will I make the horn of David to bud, I have ordained a lamp for my anointed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.132.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.132.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "His enemies will I clothe with shame: but upon himself shall his crown flourish.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
